      "text": "Rate limiting\n\nProtects backends from abuse,\nDDoS and noisy clients\n(e.g. 100 req/min/user).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": "e64",
      "originalText": "Rate limiting\n\nProtects backends from abuse,\nDDoS and noisy clients\n(e.g. 100 req/min/user).",
