      "text": "WITHOUT a gateway\n\n- Clients call many services directly\n- Auth/CORS/rate limit repeated everywhere\n- Internal structure exposed\n- Hard to change/split services",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
